     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Habits and personal experience",
     "texto": [
      "Use **jeg pleier å…** («I usually…») for a habit and **jeg kjenner meg… når…** («I feel… when…») to explain how you feel. Common reflexive verbs include **å slappe av** («to relax»). Speak from your own experience and avoid turning it into a universal recommendation."
     ],
